Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.769
-Welcome, everybody,
welcome to The Tonight Show.

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:05.338
Thank you for being here.
Thank you for watching at home.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:08.307
We had a great show.
Well, guys, today in England,

00:00:08.307 --> 00:00:10.076
the world's biggest leaders
got together

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:12.745
for the start
of the G7 Summit.

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:15.214
Yeah, it's a meeting
of leaders from the U.S.,

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:19.352
U.K., Canada, France, Germany,
Italy, and Japan.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.788
It's basically Epcot
without the day drinking.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:28.861
This is the first in person G7
in nearly two years.

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:30.663
And like everyone else,
had an in-person meeting.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:33.099
They're all thinking
this could have been a Zoom,

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:35.134
it could have been a Zoom.

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:37.804
In addition to the G7 members,
India, Australia,

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:41.241
and South Korea were invited
as guest countries.

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:42.675
And if they do well,
they get a spot

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:46.045
on the G7 spinoff
series G7 Summit Island.

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:48.114
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.448
And like they do every year,

00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:52.185
all the G7 leaders got together
for a family photo.

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:56.956
Take a look at this.
Yeah.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.357
It looks like
a choose your player,

00:00:58.357 --> 00:01:03.762
part of a law firm video game.
They had fun on the beach.

00:01:03.762 --> 00:01:05.365
And Joe Biden asked everyone
to recreate

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:06.999
the volleyball
scene from "Top Gun."

00:01:06.999 --> 00:01:10.570
You're like, I don't get this.
I read that during the summit,

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:15.274
all G7 leaders
are staying at this castle.

00:01:15.274 --> 00:01:17.143
Apparently, the world economy
is in such bad shape,

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:21.547
they all have to share an Airbnb
is you have seven world leaders

00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:23.282
all living
in the same house

00:01:23.282 --> 00:01:25.117
while Vladimir Putin
watches from home

00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:27.953
like it's an episode
of "Big Brother."

00:01:27.953 --> 00:01:30.089
[ As Putin ]
This is my favorite show.

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:31.357
[ Normal voice ] Get this,

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.125
Ahead of Biden's meeting
next week with Putin,

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:36.262
former President Trump
decided to put out a statement

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:39.132
and it said, good luck to Biden
in dealing with President Putin.

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:41.100
Don't fall asleep
during the meeting

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.436
and please give him
my warmest regards.

00:01:45.804 --> 00:01:47.674
Trump's still banned on Facebook
and Twitter,

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:49.008
so he issued that statement

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:51.177
by yelling at
a Wendy's drive through.

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:57.216
That's right, Trump had
to go through Biden

00:01:57.216 --> 00:01:59.252
because, you know, Putin didn't
give him his real phone number.

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:02.254
[ As Putin] Sure Donald, yes,
it's a write this down,

00:02:02.254 --> 00:02:06.226
1-800-588-2300
Empire Today.

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:09.896
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:10.930
[ Normal voice ]
Well, this is huge.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.565
The National Geographic Society

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:16.669
has just announced
a new fifth ocean.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.872
It's the body of water
surrounding Antarctica,

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:21.341
and it's called
the Southern Ocean.

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:22.875
So now there's the Atlantic,

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:26.178
Pacific, Indian, Arctic,
and Southern.

00:02:26.178 --> 00:02:29.882
It's such big news inspired me
to write a tiny song about it.

00:02:29.882 --> 00:02:34.987
